            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "This should now be resolved (to a certain extent) on latest `main`. Closing explorer will now check if there is any pending file system action instead of any modified buffer. This allows to skip confirmation in some cases which was asked before, like undoing to initial state or adding only blank lines to the buffer. This also makes it more in line with how `synchronize()` doesn't ask for confirmation in that cases.",
