        {
            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "Although I agree that it might be useful, that's a bit too much. It would require an extra test after every text change which is kind of expensive. Having special highlighting for modified buffers and being aware of a small set of conditions that makes modified buffer skip confirmation (basically, not introducing new file system entries) should be enough.",
